  "body": "The spec introduced a new [keyword value `absolute-anchored`](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/forms.html#css-position-absolute-anchored) for `position`, and expect it is only possible for `position` to be computed to this value when the corresponding element is using `<dialog>`.\r\n\r\nHowever, this is wrong. If the child of the element explicitly specifies `position: inherit`, it would get this keyword value as well. (`inherit` is inheriting the computed value from its parent, not specified value, in case people may be confused.) Author is not expected to do this kind of things, but the spec should define what should happen here.",
